    "Extractor-joined net name -> design-level net name for the klt pex",
    "sampler_core extraction (sim/pex-sampler-core/, issue #597).",
    "",
    "Source: layout/pex-sampler-core/pex.json's cells[0].net_aliases, verbatim --",
    "which itself was built from layout/sampler_core/lvs.json's own",
    "net_correspondence array (the klt-lvs-verified layout<->reference net",
    "map of the whole-cell 264/264-device 152/152-net match), not inferred",
    "from spelling. The entries whose keys no longer appear in a",
    "`--pins en1,...,ring_bit4 --rename-declared-pins` extraction are kept:",
    "those nets are already renamed to their declared pin name by the",
    "extractor, so the entries are inert there.",
    "",
    "Per-extraction caveat (same as klt pex --tie-net): the joined names are",
    "synthesized by the extractor from the drawn label set and can change when",
    "the layout changes. sim/pex-sampler-core/harness/pex-measure.py fails",
    "loudly (exit 1) on any joined `|`-bearing net name with no entry here,",
    "so a regenerated layout can never silently measure the wrong net."
  ],
